<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Technologies director resigns.</title>
<headline>Singapore Technologies director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Technologies Industrial Corporation Ltd said on Friday its director, Richard Lim Cherng Yih, would resign on February 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The company statement did not give any reasons for Lim's resignation.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
